<div>
  <h1 style='text-align: center;'>Verify your email</h1>

  <p>
    Hey
    {{userName}}, use the verification code below to complete your
    {{#if isLogin}}
      login
    {{else}}
      registration
    {{/if}}
    on
    <strong>Spiriment</strong>.
  </p>

  <div
    style="
    background: #F4F7F3;
    border: 1px solid #D7E0D3;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 24px;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 28px 0;
  "
  >
    <div style="font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: #7A8A7C; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 600;">
      Verification code
    </div>
    <span style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 34px; letter-spacing: 6px; color: #3A5A40;">{{verificationCode}}</span>
  </div>

  <table role="presentation" style="background: #FBF3E3; border: 1px solid #EDDDB8; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px 18px; margin: 18px 0; width: 100%;" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
    <tr>
      <td width="26" valign="top">
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="#8A6A28" stroke-width="1.8"/>
          <path d="M12 7V12L15 14.5" stroke="#8A6A28" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        </svg>
      </td>
      <td style="font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.6; color: #7A5B1E;">
        <strong>Expires in 10 minutes.</strong> Enter this code in the app to complete your
        {{#if isLogin}}login.{{else}}registration.{{/if}}
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <table role="presentation" style="background: #EEF3EC; border: 1px solid #CFDDCA; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px 18px; margin: 18px 0; width: 100%;" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
    <tr>
      <td width="26" valign="top">
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <path d="M12 3L19 6V11C19 15.4 16 19.2 12 21C8 19.2 5 15.4 5 11V6L12 3Z" stroke="#3A5A40" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          <path d="M9.5 12L11.2 13.7L14.5 10.2" stroke="#3A5A40" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        </svg>
      </td>
      <td style="font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.6; color: #35502F;">
        <strong>Security tip:</strong> Never share this code with anyone. Spiriment will never ask for it by phone, email, or text.
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p>If you didn't make this request, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
  <p>Warm regards,<br />The Spiriment Team</p>
</div>